<h2>New Connection Request</h2>

<p>Hello {{ic_name}},</p>

<p><strong>{{company_name}}</strong> wants to connect with you on Diligence.</p>

<p>If you accept this connection, you'll be able to:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Receive job assignments from {{company_name}}</li>
  <li>Log service attempts and sign affidavits</li>
  <li>View your server pay for jobs from this company</li>
</ul>

<p style="text-align: center;">
  <a href="{{action_url}}" class="button">View Connection Request</a>
</p>

<p style="font-size: 13px; color: #64748b;">
  Log in to your Diligence account to accept or decline this connection request.
</p>

<p style="font-size: 13px; color: #64748b;">
  If you don't recognize this company, you can safely decline the request.
</p>
